## BUTTONS - COLOR-ON-HOVER DYNAMIC EFFECT

# Active window buttons (Normal State: uniform silver grey)
window.active.button.iconify.unpressed.image.color: #aaaaaa
window.active.button.max.unpressed.image.color: #aaaaaa
window.active.button.close.unpressed.image.color: #aaaaaa
window.active.button.shade.unpressed.image.color: #aaaaaa
window.active.button.desk.unpressed.image.color: #aaaaaa

# Active window buttons (Hover State: pop to color)
window.active.button.iconify.hover.image.color: #dfaf8f
window.active.button.max.hover.image.color: #7f9f7f
window.active.button.close.hover.image.color: #cc9393
window.active.button.shade.hover.image.color: #4ec2e8
window.active.button.desk.hover.image.color: #fec7cd

